  "notes": "Current official serif SIGMA wordmark (new visual identity by Stockholm Design Lab, adopted 24 Feb 2025; used on sigma-global.com and post-2025 products such as the BF). Original SVG was a Figma export: 5 paths filled #333 with a no-op clipPath (clip removed, it trimmed only 0.004 units off the G); no transforms, no text. Paths merged into one, made absolute, rounded to 3 decimals; the A counter is wound opposite, so evenodd and nonzero render identically. The pre-2025 bold sans wordmark found on most existing Sigma lenses/cameras (2012-2025) is saved as an alternative in sigma-classic.json (same JSON shape; source https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:SIGMA_CORPORATION.svg, PD-textlogo). Verified 2026-10-07: the Commons original is byte-identical (3085 B) to Sigma's own site header asset https://www.sigma-global.com/common/images/logo.svg; JSON render pixel-matches the official paths (0 px differing by >50% at 40 px/unit)."
